// ================================================================
// ROSTER-001 – Build WeeklyRoster
// ================================================================
//
// PURPOSE
// -------
// Convert the visual OriginalRoster Google Sheet into normalized
// WeeklyRoster records.
//
// BUSINESS RULES
// --------------
// 1. OriginalRoster = ONLY source of scheduled engineers.
// 2. EngineerMaster = used only to validate/enrich engineers.
// 3. EngineerMaster must NEVER introduce an engineer.
// 4. ShiftMaster = source of Shift_ID and shift timings.
// 5. ConnectWise In/Out is NOT used here.
// 6. CODE-003 handles live ConnectWise availability later.
// 7. If today falls inside a roster period, use that period.
// 8. If today falls between periods, use the next upcoming period.
// 9. Sunday can contain engineers only when explicitly present
//    in OriginalRoster.
//
// L1 ROTATION RULE
// ----------------
// 1. L1 S1 engineer works Monday-Friday.
// 2. The other L1 engineer is discovered from Saturday.
// 3. Saturday L1 resource works S2 on Saturday.
// 4. That same L1 resource works S3 Tuesday-Friday.
// 5. That L1 resource has Sunday + Monday OFF.
// 6. S1 L1 does NOT work Saturday.
// 7. Engineer names are never hard-coded.
// 8. The Saturday L1 engineer is discovered from actual
//    OriginalRoster.
//
// IMPORTANT
// ---------
// The L1 normalization happens AFTER OriginalRoster has been
// parsed.
//
// Level2 and Level3 records are NOT changed.
//
// ================================================================


// ---------------------------------------------------------------
// 1. INPUT
// ---------------------------------------------------------------

const originalRows =
